I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias. On Gra we worship her the way you'd honor  
S+ anyone who held everything together.                                         
S She's not a guardian like me. She's who guardians like me answer to.          
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S She's not gone - just waiting. I've stopped questioning her timing.           
S Somewhere quiet, I'd guess. She'll show herself again when it's time.         
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S I couldn't tell you who you are. I can tell you that you found your way to    
S+ Gra, which isn't nothing.                                                    
S That's yours to answer, not mine. Whoever you are, you're welcome here.       
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Gra, in Eternias. Half underwater, half in the air - you're standing closer to
S+ the water than you might think.                                              
S You're on Gra, my island. Watch your step near the lagoon.                    
