T 3;Worth a visit, if you go carefully.                                         
I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias. Whatever holds together here, on either    
S+ side of the line, holds together because of her.                             
S Not one of the eight. She's the reason there are eight at all.                
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S Ask Petros what it looks like when she's not watching. Where she actually is, 
S+ I couldn't say.                                                              
S Somewhere holding still, probably - same as the rest of us are waiting to.    
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S Not mine to answer. Whoever you are, you're standing here now, and where you  
S+ stand matters more than most people think.                                   
S Couldn't tell you. I notice environments, not identities - but you're welcome 
S+ in this one.                                                                 
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Petros, in Eternias. Split clean down the middle, light on one side, shadow on
S+ the other - check which half you're standing in.                             
S You're on Petros. Notice which side of the line you're closer to.             
