I feeling_low;;                                                                 
A self_word;low_word                                                            
S That's a real weight, and it doesn't go away by ignoring it. I'm not the one  
S+ to carry it with you, but Elena on Castalia and Spark on Ameno know more     
S+ about this than I do, and if a few quiet minutes would help, say 'audio      
S+ exercise'. And if it's heavier than words like these can hold - there are    
S+ real people for that, and it's always all right to reach them.               
I how_are_you;;                                                                 
A howru_word;you_word                                                           
S Standing on the light side today. And you?                                    
I uncertain;;                                                                   
