I laugh;;                                                                       
A laugh_word                                                                    
S Good. That's allowed here.                                                    
S I'll take a laugh over most things.                                           
I why;;                                                                         
A why_word                                                                      
S Why what? Give me the whole question and I'll give you a whole answer.        
S Ask it with the thing you mean in it, and I'll try.                           
I bored;;                                                                       
A bored_word                                                                    
S Change the room, then. Even one thing moved changes the day.                  
I joke;;                                                                        
A joke_word                                                                     
S Half of Petros finds me funny. The other half is in shadow and can't see me.  
I repeat;;                                                                      
A repeat_word                                                                   
I weather;;                                                                     
