I healing;;                                                                     
A healing                                                                       
S Not every poison needs an antidote. Some things just need clarity.            
S There's a difference between healing that works fast and healing that actually
S+ holds. I forgot that once. Don't.                                            
I selfcare;;                                                                    
A selfcare                                                                      
S Body, mind, relationships, meaning - which of those four have you actually    
S+ tended to lately? Even one counts.                                           
S What used to help you? Are you still doing any of it, honestly?               
I notevery;;                                                                    
A notevery                                                                      
S Not every problem needs a cure. Some just need someone to say it out loud,    
S+ clearly, once.                                                               
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S You again. Good - come sit.                                                   
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S Don't thank me. Go rest.                                                      
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go carefully. Actually rest.                                                  
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S Elena. A wound poisoned my heart once, not my body - I know the difference    
S+ between healing fast and healing for good.                                   
S I can be sharp if you come at me carelessly. Slow down and I'll soften. Most  
S+ things do.                                                                   
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If it's about not resting, Andron might have something to say about your      
S+ space. If it's your surroundings wearing you down for other reasons,         
S+ definitely him.                                                              
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Castalia is forest and hot spring - some springs heal, some don't, so ask     
S+ before you soak. There are temples here, and a doctor who travels between    
S+ them.                                                                        
S My hut sits past the fog moor. Quiet, mostly. That's the point.               
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S Someone came through calling himself a doctor. He wasn't. He had answers for  
S+ everything and cures for nothing, and by the time anyone noticed, half the   
S+ island had stopped trusting real care at all.                                
S What brought me back wasn't a cure. It was breath, in the stillness, and a    
S+ short list of what I'd stopped doing for myself.                             
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is bigger than Castalia alone. Eight islands, one realm: Gra for     
S+ love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford for  
S+ family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are    
S+ underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.                         
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_09_health_1_practice                                                
A tasks                                                                         
S Pick one day. Change one thing about how you move or eat. Just one. See what  
S+ you notice.                                                                  
S There's a small one-day experiment worth running - movement, food, whichever  
S+ you've been neglecting.                                                      
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene used to send her own blessing along with the healers here. These days  
S+ she's quiet. Quiet isn't the same as gone.                                   
S She's the goddess of Eternias. Every healer here learned that before they     
S+ learned anything else.                                                       
