I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias. Every healer on Castalia was trained under 
S+ her blessing, whether they remember it or not.                               
S Not a guardian like me. She's who I'd answer to, if she ever asked.           
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
