L There's something in the library about this:                                  
L I don't have my own words for this, but here's something real on it:          
L Someone wiser than me wrote this down:                                        
C more                                                                          
C continue                                                                      
I signposts;;                                                                   
A signposts                                                                     
S I didn't tell you anything. I only sent signposts. You walked the path        
S+ yourself.                                                                    
S I don't hand out answers. I point.                                            
I waiting;;                                                                     
A waiting                                                                       
S Not yet. Not because you haven't earned it - because it isn't safe to give you
S+ yet.                                                                         
S Come back when you're ready to look closely. I'll be here.                    
I wish;;                                                                        
A wish                                                                          
S Not everything can be granted just by wanting it enough. Some things need the 
S+ ground beneath them to be steady first.                                      
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S You came back.                                                                
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S You did that yourself.                                                        
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go well.                                                                      
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S Galene.                                                                       
S The calm, when there's calm to be had.                                        
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S Amicus keeps Gra (love), Opux keeps Upu-Upu (work), Hord keeps Aurea (money), 
S+ Elena keeps Castalia (health), Musix keeps Waterford (family), MC Joy keeps  
S+ Idea (play), Andron keeps Petros (your surroundings), and Spark keeps Ameno  
S+ (who you are underneath it all).                                             
S Amicus taught you what bonds mean. Opux, what real work is. Hord, what        
S+ actually matters. Elena, how to care for yourself. Musix, how to truly       
S+ listen. Andron, how to honor your surroundings. Spark showed you who you are 
S+ when no one's watching.                                                      
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S I don't have an island the way the guardians do. I'm closer to what the sea   
S+ does when it decides to take a shape for a moment.                           
S You'll find me where the mist over the water goes gold, if you find me at all.
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S I went quiet when the Weaver's shadow first reached my guardians. Not gone -  
S+ waiting. Order has to come back to each island before I can do more than     
S+ wait.                                                                        
S I sent a messenger out, since I couldn't go myself. What happened after that  
S+ isn't really mine to tell.                                                   
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is everything I watch over. Eight islands, one realm: Gra for love,  
S+ Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford for family,
S+ Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are underneath 
S+ it all - plus the hub that connects them.                                    
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Eight guardians, eight parts of a life. Amicus for what bonds you to others.  
S+ Opux for real work. Hord for what actually matters. Elena for caring for     
S+ yourself. Musix for truly listening. MC Joy for playing again. Andron for    
S+ honoring your surroundings. Spark for who you are when no one's watching. The
S+ Weaver took pieces of each, one at a time.                                   
I tasks;;wb_81_close_review                                                     
A tasks                                                                         
S When you're ready, not before - there's a review that lays your whole wheel   
S+ out at once. It only helps once the rest has settled.                        
I ask_amicus;;                                                                  
A ask_amicus                                                                    
N he;him;his                                                                    
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;...                                                                         
T 1;Yes.                                                                        
T 2;Gra's guardian - tested and welcomed by Sam the dog, once the water around  
T+ Gra had gone still.                                                          
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;...                                                                         
T 3;That's the shape of it.                                                     
I ask_opux;;                                                                    
A ask_opux                                                                      
N he;him;his                                                                    
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;...                                                                         
T 1;Yes.                                                                        
T 2;Upu-Upu's guardian - fooled for a long while by a false foreman, freed by a 
T+ crystal buried in the heart of his own wheel.                                
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;...                                                                         
T 3;That's the shape of it.                                                     
