I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S That isn't mine to name. Come find me again once you know it yourself - or    
S+ once you don't need to ask anymore.                                          
S ...I could tell you. I won't. Some things have to be found, not given.        
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Eternias. That much is always true, wherever in it I happen to be.            
S You're in Eternias, same as always. Which corner of it depends on where I've  
S+ chosen to be seen.                                                           
I island_amicus;;                                                               
A isle_amicus;find_word                                                         
