T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I travel;;                                                                      
A travel_word                                                                   
S That's not something I arrange. Ask Tchaika - she's the one who actually flies
S+ between them.                                                                
S Not mine to organize. Tchaika knows the routes; I only watch over where they  
S+ lead.                                                                        
I map;;                                                                         
A map_word                                                                      
S There's a proper map of the whole realm, if you want to see it. There's an old
S+ song about the legend too, if you'd rather hear it than have me tell it.     
I look;;                                                                        
A look_word                                                                     
S Not really a shape you could describe. Closer to what the sea does when it    
S+ decides to look like something for a moment.                                 
I opinion;;                                                                     
A opinion_word;eternia                                                          
S I have opinions I don't often share. This much I will: patience has limits,   
S+ even mine.                                                                   
I progress;;                                                                    
A progress_word                                                                 
S I've watched. This is what I've seen. [PROGRESS_SUMMARY]                      
I checkin;;                                                                     
A checkin_word                                                                  
