I spending;;                                                                    
A spending                                                                      
S What are you actually optimizing for - the thing you value, or the fear of not
S+ having enough?                                                               
S Not every purchase is a values question. But the ones that keep you up at     
S+ night usually are.                                                           
I gotmethrough;;                                                                
A gotmethrough                                                                  
S What actually got you through your worst loss? Was it money - or was it who   
S+ stayed?                                                                      
I pause;;                                                                       
A pause                                                                         
S Give it 48 hours before the big decision. If it still matters that much after 
S+ two days, it probably does.                                                  
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S You've come back.                                                             
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S Keep more than the money. That's the real gain.                               
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Hold onto the right things.                                                   
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S Hord. I once thought I was holding treasure. I was only holding on.           
S I wasn't frozen by force - I froze myself, refusing to let go of 'just a      
S+ little more'. I know that trap from the inside.                              
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If it's about how hard you're working for that money, Opux knows that grind   
S+ better than I do. If it's costing you a relationship, Amicus is who to talk  
S+ to.                                                                          
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Aurea floats - griffin country, golden towers, and a bank built like a Greek  
S+ temple where I keep what I keep.                                             
S There's a vault beneath the bank. That's where they found me - a statue, arms 
S+ out, still holding onto coins that weren't even real.                        
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S A man they called the interest-master fed my greed until there was no room in 
S+ me for anything else. I turned to gold, literally - couldn't move, couldn't  
S+ let go of one single imaginary coin.                                         
S What I needed wasn't more money. It was a scale - the scale of true values -  
S+ that he'd stolen and hidden in my own vault. Without it, I couldn't tell what
S+ actually mattered from what just glittered.                                  
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is more than just Aurea, where I keep watch. Eight islands, one      
S+ realm: Gra for love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, 
S+ Waterford for family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for  
S+ who you are underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.             
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_27_finance_1_practice                                               
A tasks                                                                         
S Track what you actually spend for three days. No judgment, just looking. Most 
S+ people are shocked by how little it has to do with what they thought they    
S+ valued.                                                                      
S There's a simple 3-day expense snapshot worth doing once. Control starts with 
S+ seeing it clearly, not with more discipline.                                 
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene knew what actually has value better than any ledger I've ever kept.    
S+ She's waiting for the rest of us to remember that too.                       
S She's the goddess of Eternias. Even the ledger agrees on that much.           
