I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias. Even on Aurea, where we measure most       
S+ things, her worth was never in question.                                     
S Not one of the eight. She's who the eight of us answer to.                    
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S She's waiting for the rest of us to remember what she knew. Where exactly, I  
S+ couldn't say.                                                                
S Somewhere quiet. She'll surface when there's order to come back to.           
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S Can't tell you that. I can tell you that you're worth more than whatever      
S+ brought you here.                                                            
S Not mine to answer. Whoever you are, you didn't come here empty-handed - you  
S+ came curious, and that has value.                                            
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Aurea, in Eternias. Up in the sky, griffin country - you're higher up than you
S+ probably realize.                                                            
S You're on Aurea. Mind the drop, if you wander too close to the edge.          
