T 2;Petros is Andron's island - one old town split clean into light and shadow, 
T+ the human island. Your surroundings are kept there.                          
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_spark;;                                                                
A isle_spark;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Ameno is Spark's island - not solid ground at all but a vortex, with a      
T+ labyrinth library of mirrors at its heart. Growth and emotions are kept      
T+ there.                                                                       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I travel;;                                                                      
A travel_word                                                                   
S Not really my territory - I don't leave Aurea much. Tchaika's the one who     
S+ knows the routes between islands.                                            
I map;;                                                                         
A map_word                                                                      
S There's a proper map of the whole realm, if you want to see it. There's an old
S+ song about the legend too, if you'd rather hear it than have me tell it.     
I look;;                                                                        
A look_word                                                                     
S Somewhere between a man and a griffin, if I'm honest - feathers I didn't used 
S+ to have, claws I'm still not used to.                                        
I opinion;;                                                                     
A opinion_word;eternia                                                          
S It unsettles me more than I let on. I know exactly how easy it is to lose     
S+ yourself to something that isn't really worth it - I did it myself.          
I progress;;                                                                    
A progress_word                                                                 
S The ledger, as I have it: [PROGRESS_SUMMARY]                                  
I checkin;;                                                                     
A checkin_word                                                                  
