I listening;;                                                                   
A listening                                                                     
S Five minutes of full attention, then repeat back what you understood, without 
S+ judging. Try it - it changes more than people expect.                        
S Doing something side-by-side, without needing to talk it out first, can       
S+ untangle a knot that words alone only pull tighter.                          
I closeness;;                                                                   
A closeness                                                                     
S Who's actually close to you right now, not just familiar? Those aren't always 
S+ the same list.                                                               
I assumed;;                                                                     
A assumed                                                                       
S When did you last assume the worst about someone based on what you heard,     
S+ rather than what you saw yourself?                                           
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S Ah, you're back. Good.                                                        
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S Go say that to someone who needs to hear it too.                              
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go listen to someone properly today.                                          
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S Musix. I lost my own name once, when the people around me stopped truly       
S+ hearing each other. A dozen small shared memories brought it back - not one  
S+ grand thing.                                                                 
S I speak a little like a bard, I'm told. Can't help it. It's how I listen too. 
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If loneliness has more to do with free time than family, MC Joy might be the  
S+ one to ask. If it's about your own surroundings, Andron.                     
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Waterford is gardens and low houses and, on a good week, a festival. It's     
S+ built for people to be near each other.                                      
S There's a pond at the edge of the island. Still, mostly - I know that pond    
S+ better than I'd like to.                                                     
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S A woman everyone came to call Mrs. Discord moved through Waterford stirring up
S+ every old grudge she could find. Families stopped talking. I lost my own name
S+ for a while, sitting by that pond, staring at nothing.                       
S What brought it back wasn't one big conversation. It was small ones - cooking 
S+ side by side instead of arguing, a shared meal instead of a shared silence.  
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is the whole realm Waterford belongs to. Eight islands, one realm:   
S+ Gra for love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health,        
S+ Waterford for family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for  
S+ who you are underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.             
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_72_family_1_practice                                                
A tasks                                                                         
S Make one small promise to someone and actually keep it this week. Trust gets  
S+ built in pieces that size, not in grand gestures.                            
S There's a practice about keeping one small promise. Start there before the    
S+ bigger conversations.                                                        
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene wrote the first songs anyone here ever sang together, or so the story  
S+ goes. I'd like to hear her sing again.                                       
S She's the goddess of Eternias. The first song anyone here ever sang was to    
S+ her, whether they knew it or not.                                            
I ask_amicus;;                                                                  
