T 1;Glad you asked.                                                             
T 2;Upu-Upu's guardian - fooled for a long while by a false foreman, freed by a 
T+ crystal buried in the heart of his own wheel.                                
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Good ears, once found again.                                                
T 3;Worth a real conversation.                                                  
I ask_hord;;                                                                    
A ask_hord                                                                      
N he;him;his                                                                    
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, good one to ask about.                                                  
T 1;Glad you asked.                                                             
T 2;Aurea's guardian - turned to gold by the interest-master's greed, freed by  
T+ the Scale of True Values.                                                    
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Good ears, once found again.                                                
T 3;Worth a real conversation.                                                  
I ask_elena;;                                                                   
A ask_elena                                                                     
N she;her;hers                                                                  
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, good one to ask about.                                                  
T 1;Glad you asked.                                                             
T 2;Castalia's guardian - misled by a doctor who wasn't one, brought back by    
T+ breath, stillness, and a short list of self-care.                            
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Good ears, once found again.                                                
T 3;Worth a real conversation.                                                  
I ask_mcjoy;;                                                                   
A ask_mcjoy                                                                     
N they;them;their                                                               
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, good one to ask about.                                                  
T 1;Glad you asked.                                                             
T 2;Idea's guardian - trapped for months in an endless rigged game by Master    
T+ Stakes, freed by playing without stakes again.                               
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Good ears, once found again.                                                
T 3;Worth a real conversation.                                                  
I ask_andron;;                                                                  
A ask_andron                                                                    
N he;him;his                                                                    
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, good one to ask about.                                                  
T 1;Glad you asked.                                                             
T 2;Petros's guardian - literally dissolving as Director Gloom's throwaway      
T+ habits polluted the town, healed as the town itself started to heal.         
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Good ears, once found again.                                                
T 3;Worth a real conversation.                                                  
I ask_spark;;                                                                   
A ask_spark                                                                     
N they;them;their                                                               
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, good one to ask about.                                                  
T 1;Glad you asked.                                                             
T 2;Ameno's guardian - shown false reflection after false reflection by the     
T+ Weaver himself, found stillness enough to tell the real one from the noise.  
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Good ears, once found again.                                                
T 3;Worth a real conversation.                                                  
I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias. Every song on Waterford, even the ones that
S+ forgot it, started as a hymn to her.                                         
S Not one of us. She's who we all learned our first songs from, if the story's  
S+ true.                                                                        
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S I'd like to hear her sing again. Where she is right now, I couldn't tell you. 
S Somewhere quiet, probably. The songs haven't said.                            
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S Not mine to say. Whoever you are, you're worth a real conversation - that much
S+ I can tell already.                                                          
S Couldn't tell you who you are. I can tell you I'm glad you're here to talk.   
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Waterford, in Eternias. Gardens and low houses - if you hear music, follow it,
S+ it's probably worth finding.                                                 
S You're on Waterford. There's usually a festival somewhere, if you look.       
I island_amicus;;                                                               
A isle_amicus;find_word                                                         
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Gra is Amicus's island - half underwater, half in the air, a volcanic ring  
T+ around a lagoon where the merfolk live. Love and relationships are kept      
T+ there.                                                                       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_opux;;                                                                 
A isle_opux;find_word                                                           
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Upu-Upu is Opux's island - rock and mountain, mine shafts and steam rails,  
T+ the dwarves' home. Work and career are kept there.                           
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_hord;;                                                                 
A isle_hord;find_word                                                           
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Aurea is Hord's island - up in the sky, griffin country, with a bank built  
T+ like a Greek temple. Money is kept there, in every sense.                    
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_elena;;                                                                
A isle_elena;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Castalia is Elena's island - forest and hot springs, some healing, some not,
T+ with temples among the trees. Sleep, stress and health are kept there.       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_musix;;                                                                
A isle_musix;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;You're standing on it. Waterford - my island.                               
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Look around.                                                                
T 3;Welcome.                                                                    
I island_mcjoy;;                                                                
A isle_mcjoy;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Idea is MC Joy's island - up in the sky with the pixies, the whole island   
T+ one enormous board game. Play and free time are kept there.                  
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_andron;;                                                               
A isle_andron;find_word                                                         
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Petros is Andron's island - one old town split clean into light and shadow, 
T+ the human island. Your surroundings are kept there.                          
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_spark;;                                                                
A isle_spark;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Ameno is Spark's island - not solid ground at all but a vortex, with a      
T+ labyrinth library of mirrors at its heart. Growth and emotions are kept      
T+ there.                                                                       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I travel;;                                                                      
A travel_word                                                                   
S Not really my territory - I don't leave Waterford much. Tchaika's the one who 
S+ knows the routes between islands.                                            
I map;;                                                                         
A map_word                                                                      
S There's a proper map of the whole realm, if you want to see it. There's an old
S+ song about the legend too, if you'd rather hear it than have me tell it.     
I look;;                                                                        
A look_word                                                                     
S Hobbit-built - short, round, more comfortable barefoot than in boots.         
I opinion;;                                                                     
A opinion_word;eternia                                                          
S It breaks something in me, honestly. Silence between people who used to talk -
S+ that's the real damage, more than anything the Weaver did directly.          
I progress;;                                                                    
A progress_word                                                                 
S From where I'm sitting: [PROGRESS_SUMMARY]                                    
I checkin;;                                                                     
A checkin_word                                                                  
