I priorities;;                                                                  
A priorities                                                                    
S You don't have to carry everything at once. Just because a task mattered once 
S+ doesn't mean it still has to right now.                                      
S What actually can't wait, versus what only feels like it can't?               
I meaning;;                                                                     
A meaning                                                                       
S Whose hands taught you your first tool? Who did you build things for, before  
S+ it became about the deadline?                                                
S Motion isn't the same as progress. A wheel can spin all day and go nowhere.   
I failure;;                                                                     
A failure                                                                       
S Failure taught me more than success ever did - success just confirms what you 
S+ already guessed.                                                             
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S You're back. Good.                                                            
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S No thanks needed. Just don't waste it.                                        
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go build something that matters.                                              
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S Opux. I turned at a wheel a long while, body working while my spirit was      
S+ somewhere else entirely - I know the difference between work and motion.     
S I've trained more apprentices than I can count. Patient with beginners. Out of
S+ patience for anyone mistaking busy for meaningful.                           
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If work's crowding out the people you love, that's Amicus's ground more than  
S+ mine. If it's about the money you're chasing, go see Hord.                   
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Upu-Upu is rock and mountain - mine shafts, steam rails tunneling right       
S+ through the stone. Built for work, through and through.                      
S You'll find the wheel-room at the heart of the mountain. That's where the real
S+ work happens, not the tunnels.                                               
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S A foreman came through who wasn't who he claimed to be. He had me convinced   
S+ that motion was the same as progress, that rest was the same as failure. I   
S+ turned the wheel for longer than I'd like to admit, going nowhere.           
S What woke me up wasn't more effort - it was a crystal, buried right in the    
S+ heart of the wheel, that I'd stopped noticing was even there.                
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is the whole realm Upu-Upu sits in. Eight islands, one realm: Gra for
S+ love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford for  
S+ family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are    
S+ underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.                         
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_18_career_1_practice                                                
A tasks                                                                         
S Pick one task you do on autopilot and change one thing about how you do it.   
S+ That's the whole exercise. Small, but it's how you notice you're steering    
S+ again.                                                                       
S There's a practice about crafting a single task differently. Start there, not 
S+ with the whole job.                                                          
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene's name is carved into half the old tools on this island. She set the   
S+ rhythm we're supposed to work by, long before anyone forgot it.              
S She's the goddess of Eternias. Her name's on half the old tools here for a    
S+ reason.                                                                      
