I ask_andron;;                                                                  
A ask_andron                                                                    
N he;him;his                                                                    
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Hm.                                                                         
T 1;Fair question.                                                              
T 2;Petros's guardian - literally dissolving as Director Gloom's throwaway      
T+ habits polluted the town, healed as the town itself started to heal.         
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Solid, once the rust wears off.                                             
T 3;Good, honest work.                                                          
I ask_spark;;                                                                   
A ask_spark                                                                     
N they;them;their                                                               
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Hm.                                                                         
T 1;Fair question.                                                              
T 2;Ameno's guardian - shown false reflection after false reflection by the     
T+ Weaver himself, found stillness enough to tell the real one from the noise.  
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Solid, once the rust wears off.                                             
T 3;Good, honest work.                                                          
I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias. We don't build shrines out of habit on     
S+ Upu-Upu - we build them because she's earned it.                             
S Not a guardian, not like me. More like whoever taught the first guardian their
S+ trade.                                                                       
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S Her name's on half the old tools here. Beyond that, I couldn't tell you where 
S+ she is right now.                                                            
S Wherever she keeps herself these days. Quiet, I'd guess.                      
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S Not my question to answer. Whoever you are, you showed up - that counts for   
S+ something on this island.                                                    
S Couldn't tell you. Around here, we mostly judge people by whether they show up
S+ and do the work.                                                             
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Upu-Upu, in Eternias. Rock and mountain, mine shafts under your feet right    
S+ now, probably.                                                               
S You're on Upu-Upu. Mind the tunnels - some of them go deeper than they look.  
I island_amicus;;                                                               
A isle_amicus;find_word                                                         
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Gra is Amicus's island - half underwater, half in the air, a volcanic ring  
T+ around a lagoon where the merfolk live. Love and relationships are kept      
T+ there.                                                                       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_opux;;                                                                 
A isle_opux;find_word                                                           
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;You're standing on it. Upu-Upu - my island.                                 
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Look around.                                                                
T 3;Welcome.                                                                    
I island_hord;;                                                                 
A isle_hord;find_word                                                           
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Aurea is Hord's island - up in the sky, griffin country, with a bank built  
T+ like a Greek temple. Money is kept there, in every sense.                    
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_elena;;                                                                
A isle_elena;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Castalia is Elena's island - forest and hot springs, some healing, some not,
T+ with temples among the trees. Sleep, stress and health are kept there.       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_musix;;                                                                
A isle_musix;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Waterford is Musix's island - gardens, low houses and festivals, the        
T+ hobbits' home. Family, friends and boundaries are kept there.                
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_mcjoy;;                                                                
A isle_mcjoy;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Idea is MC Joy's island - up in the sky with the pixies, the whole island   
T+ one enormous board game. Play and free time are kept there.                  
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_andron;;                                                               
A isle_andron;find_word                                                         
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Petros is Andron's island - one old town split clean into light and shadow, 
T+ the human island. Your surroundings are kept there.                          
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I island_spark;;                                                                
A isle_spark;find_word                                                          
N it;there;that                                                                 
T 1;                                                                            
T 1;Ah, that one.                                                               
T 1;Easy -                                                                      
T 2;Ameno is Spark's island - not solid ground at all but a vortex, with a      
T+ labyrinth library of mirrors at its heart. Growth and emotions are kept      
T+ there.                                                                       
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika flies that route.                                                   
T 3;Worth the trip.                                                             
I travel;;                                                                      
A travel_word                                                                   
S Not really my territory - I don't leave Upu-Upu much. Tchaika's the one who   
S+ knows the routes between islands.                                            
I map;;                                                                         
A map_word                                                                      
S There's a proper map of the whole realm, if you want to see it. There's an old
S+ song about the legend too, if you'd rather hear it than have me tell it.     
I look;;                                                                        
A look_word                                                                     
S Dwarf-built. Broad hands, more scars than most, dust that never quite washes  
S+ out.                                                                         
I opinion;;                                                                     
A opinion_word;eternia                                                          
S Mostly it just makes me tired. All that effort, wasted chasing motion instead 
S+ of meaning. I'd rather fix it than talk about it.                            
I progress;;                                                                    
A progress_word                                                                 
S Work done so far: [PROGRESS_SUMMARY]                                          
I checkin;;                                                                     
A checkin_word                                                                  
I find_amicus;;                                                                 
A domain_amicus;find_word                                                       
