T 1;Right -                                                                     
T 2;Love and relationships are Amicus's - on Gra, the merfolk island.           
T 3;                                                                            
T 3;Tchaika can take you there.                                                 
T 3;Ask there, and they'll know.                                                
I find_opux;;                                                                   
A domain_opux;find_word                                                         
