:READ PROFILE EXEC A                                                            
/* PROFILE EXEC for the CHATBOT service machine (runs at AUTOLOG)        */     
/* Build 1.                                                              */     
'CP SET RUN ON'                    /* keep running with the console gone */     
'CP TERM CONMODE 3270'                                                          
'ACCESS 191 A'                     /* the 191 holds EXECs, data, session */     
'CP SPOOL PUNCH CLASS A'                                                        
'CP SPOOL PRINTER CLASS A'                                                      
'SET EMSG ON'                                                                   
/* take the reader as it is; ignore anything that arrives while logging in */   
'EXEC CHATBOT'                                                                  
:READ SPARK BOTDE A                                                             
B !...#Hallo.#Du bist da. Gut.#Wieder hier.#Du bist zurueckgekommen.            
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_CHAPTER_DONE THEN !Du hast [MY_CHAPTER_DONE] abgeschlossen. Sitz
B+ mit dem, was es dir gezeigt hat, bevor du entscheidest, was es bedeutet.     
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_CHAPTER_STARTED THEN ![MY_CHAPTER_STARTED] ist offen, aber      
B+ unfertig. Manchmal ist das der ehrlichste Ort.                               
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_ARTIFACT_READY THEN !Du hast genug Splitter fuer [MY_ARTIFACT]  
B+ gesammelt. Sag 'Splitter', wenn du es schmieden willst.                      
:READ SPARK BOTEN A                                                             
B !...#Hello.#You're here. Good.#Here again.#You came back.                     
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_CHAPTER_DONE THEN !You finished [MY_CHAPTER_DONE]. Sit with what
B+ it showed you, before you decide what it meant.                              
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_CHAPTER_STARTED THEN ![MY_CHAPTER_STARTED] is open but          
B+ unfinished. Sometimes that's the most honest place to be.                    
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_ARTIFACT_READY THEN !You've gathered enough shards for          
B+ [MY_ARTIFACT]. Say 'shards' when you want to forge it.                       
:READ SPARK NLUDE A                                                             
H CHATBOT NLU spark de build 1                                                  
