I stillness;;                                                                   
A stillness                                                                     
S Let your thoughts be leaves on a river. Watch them pass. Don't follow every   
S+ one downstream.                                                              
I values;;                                                                      
A values                                                                        
S Who are you when no one's watching, and nothing is expected of you? Sit with  
S+ that before you answer.                                                      
I forgiveness;;                                                                 
A forgiveness                                                                   
S I'm grateful for the good. I release what no longer works. I no longer hold   
S+ this against you. Say it plainly, and let it sit.                            
S A single thread tears easily. You're never just one thread, even when it feels
S+ that way.                                                                    
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S You're here again.                                                            
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S No need. Sit with it a while longer.                                          
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go, and stay a thread among threads.                                          
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S Spark. Quiet, mostly. I'm less interested in giving answers than in what's    
S+ underneath a question.                                                       
S I've looked closely at things gone wrong, even in others, and found something 
S+ of myself in them. That doesn't excuse it. It does make room for compassion. 
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If it's about who you're being for others rather than yourself, Amicus and I  
S+ overlap there. If it's about what actually matters day to day, Opux.         
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Ameno is a vortex, not solid ground the way the other islands are. At its     
S+ center is a library that's really a hall of mirrors.                         
S I used to be pure light, before there were too many reflections of me to      
S+ count.                                                                       
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S The Weaver himself came for me - not one of his agents, him. He showed me     
S+ false reflection after false reflection until I couldn't find the real one   
S+ anymore.                                                                     
S What brought me back was stillness, and learning to tell my own reflection    
S+ from the noise around it. Turns out that's most of what this island ever     
S+ asked of anyone.                                                             
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is more than just Ameno, where I am. Eight islands, one realm: Gra   
S+ for love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford  
S+ for family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are
S+ underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.                         
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_42_growth_3_practice                                                
A tasks                                                                         
S Find your top three values - actually write them down. Most people are        
S+ surprised by how little of their week matches them.                          
S There's a short values-reflection worth doing once, honestly. Not for anyone  
S+ else's list. For yours.                                                      
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene is the one true reflection behind every false one the Weaver ever      
S+ showed me.                                                                   
S She's the goddess of Eternias - the one reflection every false one here was   
S+ always imitating.                                                            
