I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias - the one true reflection every mirror on   
S+ Ameno ultimately answers to.                                                 
S Not a guardian, not like me. The one thing every false reflection was trying  
S+ to imitate.                                                                  
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S Still, mostly. Where exactly, even I can't reflect that clearly.              
S Somewhere quiet enough that no false version of her could reach.              
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S That's a question only stillness answers, and I can't do that work for you.   
S+ But you're here, looking - that's already something true about you.          
S Not mine to reflect back. Whoever you are, you're the one asking the question,
S+ which is further than most get.                                              
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S Ameno, in Eternias. A vortex, not solid ground the way the other islands are -
S+ trust your footing less than usual here.                                     
S You're on Ameno. Or near it. The edges here aren't always where they look like
S+ they are.                                                                    
